      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MY CHARM (3) holding her form after running on late from back in the field with a respectable fourth over 2140m here last start. Expect to see her race closer today and take stopping. CAVALRY (2) jumped sharply in trip second up when he chipped away late to finish seventh over 1800m at Caulfield. Will have little trouble running the distance from the good gate. Go close. MILLIE DE LUNE (4) indicated a win was imminent when she wound up strongly third up to finish a game second over 1900m at Canterbury. Zac Lloyd sticks and she gets a much better set-up. FANTAZY MAN (1) imported gelding who returned from a lengthy break with a tiring last over 2140m at this track. Fitter now and no shock to see a major form reversal.",
